24
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,622
Archimedes famously said,

25
00:01:00,622 --> 00:01:03,370
give me a lever long enough and a place

26
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:04,004
to stand,

27
00:01:04,004 --> 00:01:05,837
