28
00:01:05,837 --> 00:01:06,823
For centuries,

29
00:01:06,823 --> 00:01:10,629
business relied on two forms of permissioned leverage:

30
00:01:10,629 --> 00:01:11,052
labor,

31
00:01:11,052 --> 00:01:13,236
