32
00:01:13,236 --> 00:01:14,082
and capital,

33
00:01:14,082 --> 00:01:17,253
meaning millions of dollars under management.

34
00:01:17,253 --> 00:01:20,002
Both require someone else's permission.

35
00:01:20,002 --> 00:01:21,904
Over the last thirty years,

36
00:01:21,904 --> 00:01:23,666
a third category emerged:

37
00:01:23,666 --> 00:01:27,049
products with zero marginal cost of replication,

38
00:01:27,049 --> 00:01:29,022
