39
00:01:29,022 --> 00:01:32,616
You do not need a venture capitalist's signature to

40
00:01:32,616 --> 00:01:34,166
write a Python script,

41
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:36,633
publish an educational video essay,

42
00:01:36,633 --> 00:01:38,536
or ship a digital template.

43
00:01:38,536 --> 00:01:42,200
Recording a video for ten thousand viewers costs the

44
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,160
exact same energy as recording it for ten.

45
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:48,422
Model Three is one of the sharpest wake-up calls

46
00:01:48,422 --> 00:01:50,257
in modern personal finance:

47
00:01:50,257 --> 00:01:53,520
you are not going to gain true financial freedom

48
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:55,423
