54
00:02:03,851 --> 00:02:04,870
When you sleep,

55
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:05,958
take a vacation,

56
00:02:05,958 --> 00:02:06,773
or burn out,

57
00:02:06,773 --> 00:02:08,201
