58
00:02:08,201 --> 00:02:10,580
Real wealth requires owning equity:

59
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:12,075
a piece of a business,

60
00:02:12,075 --> 00:02:13,570
intellectual property,

61
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:14,182
software,

62
00:02:14,182 --> 00:02:15,269
a media catalog,

63
00:02:15,269 --> 00:02:19,687
or diversified productive assets that earn while you are offline.

64
00:02:19,687 --> 00:02:22,610
Keep your salary as a launchpad to pay your

65
00:02:22,610 --> 00:02:24,037
bills without stress,

66
00:02:24,037 --> 00:02:28,319
then systematically channel your surplus hours and savings into

67
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,950
assets you actually own.

68
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:32,859
Model Four flips hustle culture upside down.

69
00:02:32,859 --> 00:02:33,983
Without leverage,

70
00:02:33,983 --> 00:02:37,488
working eighty hours a week produces roughly twice as

71
00:02:37,488 --> 00:02:38,942
much as working forty.

72
00:02:38,942 --> 00:02:40,463
Under massive leverage,

73
00:02:40,463 --> 00:02:41,521
working frantic,

74
00:02:41,521 --> 00:02:45,819
exhausted hours actually destroys value because tired brains make

75
