79
00:02:55,935 --> 00:02:58,910
who is right eighty-five percent of the time,

80
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:01,952
even if the second captain rows twice as hard.

81
00:03:01,952 --> 00:03:05,456
That is why Warren Buffett spends over eighty percent

82
00:03:05,456 --> 00:03:08,828
of his workday reading quietly behind a closed door

83
00:03:08,828 --> 00:03:13,258
rather than packing his calendar with back-to-back status meetings.

84
00:03:13,258 --> 00:03:16,697
Treat your calendar like a fortress so your judgment

85
00:03:16,697 --> 00:03:17,490
stays sharp.

86
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:21,231
Model Five explains why impatience ruins smart builders.

87
00:03:21,231 --> 00:03:23,368
Every meaningful reward in life,

88
